      "explanation": "The energy of an electron in a hydrogen atom is given by the following formula:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.871ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.207ex\" height=\"2.864ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.9 5837.5 1266.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(771,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1523,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2578.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,398) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" transform=\"translate(2556,0) scale(1.414)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2792.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1262.8,-377.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(633,289) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"3018.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nwhere n is the principal quantum number (Bohr orbit number). To find the energy in the third Bohr orbit (n = 3), we can use the formula:\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.889ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23.437ex\" height=\"2.882ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.9 10359 1273.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(771,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1452.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2508.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,398) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" transform=\"translate(2556,0) scale(1.414)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2792.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1298.2,-377.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(533,289) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"3018.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6044.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(7100.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,398) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" transform=\"translate(2556,0) scale(1.414)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2792.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\" transform=\"translate(444,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1452.5,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\"></use></g><rect width=\"3018.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\n<br><br>\nNow, we are given the energy of the electron in the first Bohr orbit (n = 1):\n<br><br>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style